  "target_operation_id": "facade:com.ly.flight.chainsaas.refund.facade.RefundFacade#billSupplement",
  "checked_contract_corrections": [
    "ReportUniqueKeyRequest声明transactionType/queryDate/ticketNo/passengerName/pnr；父类traceId被实际Validator要求。该唯一键查询没有ownerId，主体/采购商/供应商必须检查report响应。",
    "实际QueryReportByUniqueKeyValidator要求traceId、transactionType、queryDate、ticketNo；仅TICKETING(2)路径额外要求PNR和乘客姓名。本例REFUND(3)仍传入用户条件，并在响应验证。",
    "ReportSingleResponse的report可为null，即使success=true；只有业务成功且明确null才属于无数据。",
    "report.id为Long；report.ownerId/buyerId/merchantId为String；transactionType和isSaveDb为Integer。REFUND=3、NOT_RECORD=0；不能使用Boolean false。",
    "report.ext应解析为DistributionReportExt，其退款ARC键为arcRefundAccount；transactionType位于report本体，不能放到ext顶层。",
    "saveReport入参为traceId+report对象+arcRefundAccount等账单对象，不是顶层ownerId/ticketNo。saveReport可能返回票号+PNR+交易类型已有记录，仍须按原条件回查验证。",
    "Refund BillSupplementRequest实际字段id/billDate/reportSource/arcBillVO/bspBillVO；ARC分支传arcBillVO，id必须来自分销report.id。",
    "queryDetailByRefundNo返回saasRefundOrderVO，主体字段是platFormId，JSON ext内的supplementId由BillRefundConverter保存。"
  ],
